    "armed": "Armed by default, with no arming variable. REVIEWSENSEI_ALLOW_CHECKOUT_IMPORT=1 is the only opt-out. The checkout lane is separated by test discovery rather than by disarming: unittest discover skips the non-package lane directories and tests/conftest.py makes pytest match it.",
    "rule": "review_sensei.__file__ must resolve under sys.prefix. When REVIEWSENSEI_CHECKOUT_ROOT is set it adds a second rule, that the package must not resolve under that checkout's src/, and the variable must name a directory containing src/ so misconfiguration fails closed.",
    "lane_marker": "REVIEWSENSEI_DIST_SAFE_LANE=1 marks the suite as the packaged one extracted from the sdist. It no longer arms the guard and is used only to assert checkout-only modules are absent."
